# Sales Performance Dashboard

1. Project Title / Headline

**Sales Performance Dashboard – Power BI**

 2. Short Description / Purpose

A Power BI dashboard designed to analyze sales performance and provide clear, interactive insights into sales, profit, orders, products, customers, and regional performance.

 3. Tech Stack

* Power BI
* Power Query
* DAX

 4. Data Source

* Private Source

 5. Features

* Data cleaning and transformation using Power Query
* Interactive dashboard with dynamic filters and slicers
* Analysis of sales, profit, orders, and quantity sold
* Category and sub-category performance analysis
* State and city-wise sales analysis
* Customer and payment mode analysis
* Sales and profit trend analysis
* KPI cards for key business metrics
* Easy-to-understand visual representation of sales data
